  partName: Lower Intake Manifold Gasket
  description: The Lower Intake Manifold Gasket is a tiny, thin-flat component located
    at the middle-center-front of the engine, sealing the lower section of the intake
    manifold to prevent air and fuel leaks. Made of Material.006, this gasket is
    essential for maintaining the engine's performance and efficiency. An interesting
    detail about the Lower Intake Manifold Gasket is that its lower position allows
    it to provide an additional layer of protection against leaks and damage to the
    intake manifold.
  audioExplanation: {fileID: 0}
